# A watched folder: a search on screen follows files added and removed,
# with no reindex. The run copies cordero.png into the folder after about
# 5 s and removes it after about 10 s (see the PR for the command).
wait 2500
type cordero
wait 1000
shot 1-nothing-yet
wait 3500
shot 2-file-added
wait 5000
shot 3-file-removed
